---
title: Chimichurri Sauce
servings: 4
tags: AI
source.author: AI Cooking Agent
course: Side dish
prep time: 15 minutes
difficulty: Easy
---

Prepare a #food processor{} bowl.

Add @parsley{1/2%cup}, @cilantro{1/4%cup}, @shallot{}(peeled), @garlic{2%cloves}(peeled), and @red wine vinegar{1%Tbsp}.

Add half of the @olive oil{3/4%cup}(extra virgin).
With the food processor, lightly pulse or chop the ingredients, do not fully puree.
While running, slowly add more of the remaining olive oil as needed to achieve a saucy consistency.

When the desired consistency is reached, transfer the mix to a bowl, cover, and refrigerate for ~{1-2%hours} to let the flavors meld.
